<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORBES LIFTS HALF YR SHARE, DIV.</title>
<headline>FORBES LIFTS HALF YR SHARE, DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   22.7	  vs   19.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  7.0	  vs    5.4</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   42.4	  vs   35.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   56.1	  vs   46.4</p>
<p>    Tax rate (pct)	  24.1	  vs   23.5</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    6.4	  vs    5.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		 306.9	  vs  255.7</p>
<p>Full name: Forbes Group Ltd (financial services)</p>
<p>NOTE - Dividend was declared and paid on October 3. The</p>
<p>company listed on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange on November 4.</p>
<p>Forbes said it was on track to achieve the attributable profit</p>
<p>forecast of 70 million rand for the full year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
